.docs/decisions/0113-human-and-agent-analysis-as-first-class-claim-sources.md:168:Two committed claims at the same `(entity_id, claim_type, field_path)` with different `claim_text` are a contradiction. Contradictions are **never auto-resolved**. Both claims remain in `claim_state = 'committed'` with a contradiction marker:
.docs/decisions/0113-human-and-agent-analysis-as-first-class-claim-sources.md:173:  field_path_ref  TEXT NOT NULL,   -- "<entity_id>:<claim_type>:<field_path>"
