.docs/decisions/0113-human-and-agent-analysis-as-first-class-claim-sources.md:175:  claim_b_id      TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES intelligence_claims(id),
.docs/decisions/0113-human-and-agent-analysis-as-first-class-claim-sources.md:189:A claim is content-addressed by `dedup_key = hash(entity_id, claim_type, field_path, normalized_claim_text)`. Normalization includes trimming, Unicode normalization, and type-specific canonicalization (e.g., dates to ISO, names to case-folded).
